<title>India: Kashmir, Manipur and the Maoist belt: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/india/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-india-2026-11-09T17:42:57.418Z</guid>
<pubDate>Mon, 09 Nov 2026 17:42:57 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Hundreds rallied in Ukhrul, Manipur demanding an end to ethnic violence and the SoO pact. Manipur chief minister Khemchand Singh met families of two Kuki youths killed in Kangpokli and said the case was handed to NIA while the home minister Govindas Konthoujam said displaced persons would be returned safely. Prime Minister Modi declared the Bastar district Naxal free and warned that &amp;quot;dimagi&amp;quot; Naxals have infiltrated political parties, while over 4,000 firearms were recovered in Manipur raising new security concerns. The Manipur census remains suspended until April 2027 per the high court, and 437 battle-related deaths were recorded in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Hindu&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Economic Times&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMingFBVV95cUxPQXFrNDFIbHJuRVVSTHpFcjRXcXFPQ0VXaFk2VTRzc0FRbzhSV2dScHFwWWRvMkQ3dkdJSmR3LWh1VG1DQUtaT3d1WkRJQUI2Y3NZY3lLdEY5dlN1ZVJ2QkNKSUsyZTdocUs3ejJKU2MtN2dHM19YUWVTTkNuS203bzJYbDhEVkxYUWpFdkppVFJiSU1ZTENRQlZ4S3ZCdw?oc=5&quot;&gt;Urban Acres&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;India Today NE&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;India Today NE&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Deccan Chronicle&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Economic Times&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;The New Indian Express&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Times of India&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;The New Indian Express&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Free Press Kashmir&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.goo